{"id":"20665","t":{"th":"เพลงรักสองหัวใจ","ro":"Shigatsu wa Kimi no Uso","en":"Your lie in April","na":"四月は君の嘘"},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx20665-TLgkL8T8IRFd.png","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx20665-TLgkL8T8IRFd.png","color":"#e4bb50","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20665-j4kSsfhfkM24.jpg","fmt":"TV","status":"FINISHED","eps":22,"dur":23,"season":"FALL","year":2014,"start":"2014-10-10","country":"JP","genres":["Drama","Music","Romance","Slice of Life"],"score":84,"pop":623712,"studio":"A-1 Pictures","desc":"Piano prodigy Arima Kousei dominated the competition and all child musicians knew his name. But after his mother, who was also his instructor, passed away, he had a mental breakdown while performing at a recital. This resulted in him no longer being able to hear the sound of his piano playing. Two years later, Kousei hasn’t touched the piano and views the world without any flair or color. He was content at living out his life with his good friends Tsubaki and Watari until, one day, a girl changed everything. Miyazono Kaori is a pretty, free spirited violinist whose playing style reflects her personality. Kaori helps Kousei return to the music world and show that it should be free and mold breaking unlike the structured and rigid style Kousei was used to.","descTh":"นักเปียโนอัจฉริยะ Arima Kousei ครองการแข่งขัน และนักดนตรีเด็กทุกคนรู้จักชื่อของเขา แต่หลังจากที่แม่ของเขาซึ่งเป็นผู้สอนของเขาเสียชีวิตด้วย เขาก็มีอาการทางจิตขณะแสดงคอนเสิร์ต ส่งผลให้เขาไม่ได้ยินเสียงการเล่นเปียโนอีกต่อไป สองปีต่อมา Kousei ไม่ได้สัมผัสเปียโนและมองโลกโดยปราศจากสีสันหรือสีสันใดๆ เขาพอใจที่ได้ใช้ชีวิตกับเพื่อนดีๆ สึบากิและวาตาริ จนกระทั่งวันหนึ่ง เด็กผู้หญิงคนหนึ่งได้เปลี่ยนแปลงทุกสิ่งทุกอย่าง มิยาโซโนะ คาโอริเป็นนักไวโอลินที่น่ารักและร่าเริงซึ่งมีสไตล์การเล่นที่สะท้อนถึงบุคลิกของเธอ คาโอริช่วยให้โคเซกลับมาสู่โลกแห่งดนตรีอีกครั้ง และแสดงให้เห็นว่ามันควรจะเป็นอิสระและไร้เชื้อราซึ่งไม่เหมือนสไตล์ที่มีโครงสร้างและเข้มงวดที่โคเซอิคุ้นเคย","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":"licensor","descTh":"gtranslate"},"trailer":"3aL0gDZtFbE","al":"https://anilist.co/anime/20665","mal":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/23273","jp":null,"sched":[],"prov":[{"p":"iqiyi","r":"TH","u":"https://www.iq.com/album/%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%A7%E0%B9%83%E0%B8%88-2014-2g6mip8tge9?lang=th_th","lang":"sub","eps":[["1","https://www.iq.com/play/%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%A7%E0%B9%83%E0%B8%88-ep-1-q94kl5qu7k?lang=th_th",1633626000,"d","q:2/20211008/27/97/v_162676864_m_601_zh-CN",null,{"d":1376}],["2","https://www.iq.com/play/%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%A7%E0%B9%83%E0%B8%88-ep-2-25iph6su9to?lang=th_th",1633626000,"d","q:1/20211008/07/32/v_162676872_m_601_zh-CN",null,{"d":1379}],["3","https://www.iq.com/play/%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%A7%E0%B9%83%E0%B8%88-ep-3-1dskq9ilw2c?lang=th_th",1633626000,"d","q:8/20211008/af/93/v_162676899_m_601_zh-CN",null,{"d":1378}],["4","https://www.iq.com/play/%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%A7%E0%B9%83%E0%B8%88-ep-4-11ubpp6hshk?lang=th_th",1633626000,"d","q:3/20211008/3c/04/v_162676908_m_601_zh-CN",null,{"d":1374}],["5","https://www.iq.com/play/%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%A7%E0%B9%83%E0%B8%88-ep-5-1sp75mhllas?lang=th_th",1633626000,"d","q:0/20211008/13/76/v_162676914_m_601_zh-CN",null,{"d":1379}],["6","https://www.iq.com/play/%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%9E%E0%B8%A5%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%AB%E0%B